WEBVTT

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:18.030
It looks like we're going to get hit hard.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.750
What's up?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.120
I'm back.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.480
Hey, Yuuki!

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.740
Good job.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.180
You're back.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.480
Wait right there!

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.360
It appears that Typhoon 17 will continue
its northern progression,

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.020
What's going on?

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.990
Is it really headed this way?

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.050
and will arrive on the eastern shore
sometime early this morning.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:47.500
It's supposed to touch down tonight.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.840
And with the extreme wind
and rain brought by 17,

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.010
viewers are advised to exercise
extreme caution.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:50.570
I see.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.840
If possible, people should remain
inside until 17 passes.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.600
Darn. Looks like nothing but rain and wind,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.630
and nothing but bad news for deliveries.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:05.080
Yuuki, sit down!

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.080
I guess, as long as it doesn't
get worse, we can manage.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:12.250
I hope it'll have passed by the time
we have to make our deliveries.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:16.450
Or maybe we'll be lucky, and
get the eye of the storm.

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.150
Does that hurt?

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:19.140
No.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.400
Hey everyone!

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.290
Hello!

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.420
You're back, Kana-chan.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:25.400
Welcome back!

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:25.970
Hey!

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:26.740
Hello.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:29.470
I had to come back in the rain!

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:32.100
It doesn't look like your umbrella
did much good.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.290
Well, the wind made the umbrella
practically useless.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.950
I take it all back!

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.360
Viva la typhoon!!!

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:54.850
It looks like we're going to get
a typhoon today, Grandma.

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:58.450
I'm sensing many problems already.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.810
My First Time At the
Bath With Everyone

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:34.020
It appears that Typhoon 17 has picked up some
speed and continues its northern progression.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.840
Typhoon 17 is estimated to arrive on
the eastern shore sometime tonight.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.740
Does anyone else feel like we've had more
typhoons than normal this year?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:45.620
Oh, that's right. "Number 17" means
that it's the 17th typhoon this year.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:46.730
That's right.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.310
I guess in other countries, they
give their typhoons names.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.490
Yeah. Names like "Jane" or "Melissa."

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:56.500
Really? So if we did that in Japanese,

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.480
maybe we could call it something
like "Miss June."

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:00.280
Or the name "Hanako" would
be kind of cute.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:02.620
Oh, yes...

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.370
It could be a cuddly typhoon
like "Kana-chan,"

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:11.890
or an acid-tongued typhoon like "Saki."
Oh, it'd be so cute!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.750
And then, in the breeze of your
own winds... perhaps...

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.800
your skirt might blow up and then...

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:25.730
I think you've got a sex-typhoon
raging in your head, 24/7.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:29.020
Who are you calling "acid-tongued," anyway?!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:32.070
Oops! I didn't think you were
actually listening, Chief!

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:36.520
At any rate, everybody needs to
be prepared for an emergency.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:40.380
You're right! We've got to get
a lot of buckets and bowls!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.910
Do you really think our
roof is that crummy?

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:47.110
You're right; that's silly.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:51.590
First things first; we've got to
change into our bathing suits!

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:54.760
We're going to get all wet in the
rain anyway, so might as well!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.820
My dazzling harem!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.760
Not. Happening.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.240
Maybe we should board up

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.660
the front shutters until the
morning delivery truck comes.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.770
We should.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.300
I'll do it!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.660
Hold it Yume! Not like that!

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.240
Yay, typhoon!

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.630
I'm going to help.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:24.030
Huh?

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.500
Why are you in a bathing suit too?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:31.940
Because Yume and I are soulmates.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.520
Ah geez, change as soon
as you come back in.

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:38.120
It's so warm!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.290
It's really coming down!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.140
Good thing I'm wearing a bathing suit!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.380
She's really having fun, huh?

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:46.440
She loves the snow and rain.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.070
I didn't know that.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.270
It's pretty dog-like, if you ask me.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:52.740
I don't know. Yume strikes
me as more of a cat.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:57.820
No! Yuuki's the cat, though!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.960
What are you talking about?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.230
They're human beings.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.460
S-Sorry.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:11.620
Can you please stop playing for
now, and come in and change?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:12.870
All right!

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:14.940
Okay.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:25.810
It's getting worse and worse.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.070
Hey, want to make some
Teruteru Monk dolls?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:32.570
Note: Paper dolls that supposedly
bring better weather.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.080
Oh, let's!

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.570
Can we, Chief?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.700
Do what you want.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.680
Thank you!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:42.000
Hey, Yume, did you know these dolls purpose
isn't really to make the rain stop?

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.250
How rude, of course I know!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:51.820
Once long long ago, they say there lived
a monk who could clear up any sky,

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:56.030
no matter how horrible the weather was.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:00.150
Whenever villagers tried to get him
to stay, he would tell them that

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:05.170
there were others waiting
for him in other villages.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:09.280
He then told them: "Make a doll just like
this and hang it up.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:14.530
No matter where I am, I will come
to any house with this marker."

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.590
My marker is done!

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:22.700
I hope the monk Teruteru will come soon!

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:23.820
You...?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.160
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.040
Think about it, Yume.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.110
That stuff all happened
a long long time ago.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.470
He's not around anymore.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.590
Of course the first one isn't anymore.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:37.580
Right now the twentieth monk in
that line is running around!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.810
No one's ever seen him, so I doubt it...

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.020
He can run the circumference
of the earth, if he wants to.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.300
He can move at untold
speeds, if he wants to!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:50.130
I mean, you can't see air, but that doesn't
mean it doesn't exist, right?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:53.400
You gotta get in touch with
reality, Hina-chan.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.640
Let's make more dolls!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.530
She's never going to grow up if
you keep babying her like this!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.990
You can't be together forever, you know.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.560
She's never going to be able to take
care of herself, at this rate.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:09.790
Just keep making a bunch of dolls,
and the monk will show up!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:14.090
Together... forever...

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.980
She's never going to be able
to take care of herself,

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.180
so I guess she'll just have to be with me.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.850
You should make some too, Yuuki.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.410
I'm coming.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.510
C'est la vie - that's life.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.940
We really made a lot of them!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.970
We really did!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.510
Check it out!

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:40.340
Those are pretty accurate.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.270
This one's Kana-chan, isn't it?

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.660
It really does look like her.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.650
Oops, I saw under your skirt...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.620
Kissy, kissy...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.590
Stop that! Please stop!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.430
Why do you do things like this?

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.670
How would you like it if I did
stuff like that to your doll?

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:11.900
Don't do it to my doll; do it to ME!!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.580
That's it, that's it! Don't hold back!

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.530
Haruharu really likes her, doesn't she?

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.130
Knock it off, you two!

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:27.260
You're crushing her!

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:39.350
Just like the dolls!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.600
Hey, let's make a big one!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.280
All right, but what are we
going to use as its coat?

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.340
We don't have one big enough.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.020
What if we use a raincoat?

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.520
You can use mine, if you like.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.050
But how would we know which one is yours?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.400
They don't have our names in them.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.960
Sniff, sniff! This one's Yuuki's.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.630
Wow.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:11.440
It's not that great. I can
only recognize hers.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.760
And now, the big doll's done too!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.460
Let's put it out with the others!

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:18.400
I'll let you do it.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.760
Now all we have to do is wait for the monk.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.720
What's so bad about being fully naked?

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:35.050
Ughaaa! I saw something
I shouldn't have!

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.300
Huh, what the?

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.900
It looks like the rain has let up!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.740
The dolls really worked!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.340
I think we're in the eye of the storm now.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.330
Want to go down to the public bath

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.900
while the storm isn't so strong?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:58.020
This might be a good day to all go together
and to get it done in one go.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:59.670
That's a good idea.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:00.970
Yeah.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.950
The bath is more fun when
we're all together.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.810
My dazzling harem, part two!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:15.020
Viva la typhoon!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.180
Do you understand what actions

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.790
are and are not appropriate
for a public place?!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:20.810
Yes.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.370
There's someone on the ground!

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.090
This aura...

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.830
Her Lolita powers are at 680,000!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:35.450
That can be none other than Kana-chan's
friend: Mika-chan!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.420
Mika-chan...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.110
what happened to your clothes?!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.490
It's nothing!

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.890
I was just taking a leisurely
walk on a rainy night!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.450
Well, we're all going down
to the public bath now,

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.630
so maybe you should come with us?

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:52.880
The bath?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.600
Yeah!

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.100
Women

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.680
All right, I'm leaving you a basket here.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.500
You can put your clothes in it.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.510
What clothes?

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.440
The clothes you take off.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.900
How can you even suggest that
I'd do something so shameless?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.270
But we're at the public bath...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.740
I guess so.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.910
But...

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.210
We're going in now.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:45.320
All right!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.500
Let me see your glasses
for a second, Haruka.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.210
What do you need them for, Chief?

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.180
Why don't we go in too?

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:54.150
Then let's do it!

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.630
What are you doing?

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:57.010
We're getting in the bath, right?

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.980
So help me undress already!

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.030
Huh?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.020
Come on! Hurry up!

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:03.320
All right...

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.980
Let's get ready to rumble!

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:14.910
Just when I managed to get to
an unprecedented paradise!

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:21.980
But no! I may not be able to see,
yet I burn with the fires of Eros!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.530
It's telling me to grasp love
with my own hands!

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.500
Haruka!

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.150
Here I go!

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:36.220
I think you understand the consequences
of any misconduct here.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.660
Aww, man.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.540
This bath is huge.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:52.060
This is your first time in a public bath, huh?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.020
Yes.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.550
Then why don't I tell you how it works?

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.220
Please do that.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.230
This red button here starts the hot water.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.410
All right.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.050
It really does!

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.280
And then, if the water is too hot,

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.860
this blue button starts the cold.

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.700
And then, here's the shower.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.990
This comes in handy when you
want to wash your hair;

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.240
just push this lever here.

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.390
You can go ahead and use
my soap and shampoo.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:26.870
But you don't have a washcloth, do you?

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.680
Want to buy one at the front desk?

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.390
Hey Kana, why don't you use this?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.960
Yume-san!

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:35.540
I'm going to use Yuuki's.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.210
Thank you!

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.660
Sorry about that!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.940
I gave them my sponge.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:41.730
Welcome back.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.040
Just let me use yours later.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.320
Of course.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.340
Thanks, Yuuki!

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.560
You're so nice; that's why I like 'ya!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.330
Oh Yume...

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.570
What's wrong, Mika-chan?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.720
What?

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.830
I guess we have a tie.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.120
What's the contest?

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:10.690
Oh, Yuuki, stop it!

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.850
A crab is like this... like this!

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:30.210
Mika-chan, you're still soapy.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.570
Sorry, was that too hot?

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.970
I'm fine!

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.530
What are you doing?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:45.320
You're so cute, Mika!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.660
Look at you, such a precocious thing!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.910
Don't worry, let your big sister make

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:52.650
those nice and big for you!

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.880
No stop! Let go of me!

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:54.880
Haruka-san!

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.590
You're not allowed to get
out of the tub, Haruka!

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.200
Come on then, come back!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.040
You're so cruel, Chief!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.700
Just let me massage Kana's for a bit!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.040
Just a tiny bit!

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:18.630
I can do some laundry here
and kill two birds

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.920
with one stone.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:25.360
You're not honestly trying to
get away with doing your

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:28.300
laundry in a public bath. Right?

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.790
No...

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:37.380
Ahh! It's hot, but it feels so good!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:42.120
An exceptional experience
really, this bath.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.770
I'm glad you like it.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:56.940
It's the chance I've waited so long for!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.880
No!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:03.410
Super special 16 shot combo!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.810
Stop it! Stop it!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.700
What have we here, Mika-chan?

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.210
What do you want?

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.790
You can't stop looking at
my breasts, can you?

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.720
Do you want big breasts too?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:25.320
Want your big sister to make
them big for you?

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.700
You can do that?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.370
She hit me again!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.870
That's it!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.220
But Chief! I just now managed
to get Mika-chan interested!

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.510
Danger, danger!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:00.930
What's wrong, Kana?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.770
You probably had a growth spurt.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.570
A growth spurt?

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:13.830
Yeah.

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:22.020
So, who's in the mood for
some milk? My treat.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.220
Oh my god, did hell just freeze over?

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.990
Everyone. But you.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.230
Now put your hand on your hips.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.410
Your hand on your hips.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.370
Hold the bottle tight.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:37.210
Tight.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:39.190
And chug it down in one go!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:40.690
Chug.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.580
You have a milk mustache!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.050
So do you! You're practically Santa Claus!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.200
This fruit-flavored milk is the best!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.910
But you always drink regular
milk, right, Yuuki?

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:09.460
I've always liked plain milk best.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.520
So that's why these got so huge.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.010
They say that drinking a lot of milk

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.440
while you're young makes them big.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.020
Can you please stop treating me like a cow?

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.980
Come on, Chief, I said I was sorry!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.720
Won't you buy me one?

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.930
Man, would I like some milk!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.600
But if at all possible, fruit-milk
would be best.

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:41.160
Just when I finally got a chance
to be with my harem!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.470
Oh, the inhumanity!

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:50.130
The typhoon had us really
worried, Grandma.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:55.240
But you know, now I think
it's going to be okay.

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:31.890
Mika-chan, will you be okay by yourself?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.090
Don't worry. Of course I can
make it home by myself.

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:37.510
But I have to thank you all.

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:40.070
This experience at the bath
was truly a pleasure.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.360
I'm off then.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.520
See ya.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.100
Oh my.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.720
Grandma...

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.360
Actually,

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:06.670
I can't shake the uneasy feeling that
something crazy will happen!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.500
Episode 5 - Digest Clips

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:44.860
My First Ghost Story

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.600
Next time: My First Ghost Story

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:34.780
Sh... Sh... She'll go!

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:35.600
Oh, Grandma!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:36.350
M-Marietta.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:37.190
Tachometer G.

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:37.960
Jingletta!

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:39.030
Tom is pushy!

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:40.100
Schema.

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:41.400
Making a bet!

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:44.850
My bet! My betting ticket!
